but the thing that would force them off

00:08:50.563 --> 00:08:51.864
is if there was an attack

00:08:51.864 --> 00:08:53.933
that caused major damage,

00:08:53.933 --> 00:08:55.801
something that he could not ignore,

00:08:55.801 --> 00:08:57.003
because then

00:08:57.003 --> 00:08:59.138
if he did, he would seem weak

00:08:59.138 --> 00:09:00.339
and he would just,

00:09:00.339 --> 00:09:01.307
you know, open the door

00:09:01.307 --> 00:09:02.842
to his political rivals.

00:09:02.842 --> 00:09:04.877
And Colonel, is a quick follow to that.

00:09:04.911 --> 00:09:06.345
You think that the Ukrainians

00:09:06.345 --> 00:09:07.880
are still pushing for what everybody at

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:08.981
this point is still saying

00:09:08.981 --> 00:09:09.782
is a red line,

00:09:09.782 --> 00:09:10.883
although many still say

00:09:10.883 --> 00:09:12.752
go ahead and cross it anyway.

00:09:12.752 --> 00:09:14.854
And that would be Crimea itself.

00:09:16.355 --> 00:09:17.089
Yeah, I think that's

00:09:17.089 --> 00:09:18.324
what the Ukrainians are going to do.

00:09:18.324 --> 00:09:20.226
I think these are probably feints

00:09:20.226 --> 00:09:22.361
in the direction of Russia right now.

00:09:22.828 --> 00:09:24.897
But, you know, anything is possible.

00:09:24.931 --> 00:09:26.165
But I think Ukraine

00:09:26.165 --> 00:09:28.868
is going to make Crimea its big target.

00:09:28.868 --> 00:09:29.268
All right.

00:09:29.268 --> 00:09:30.436
And that really will be

00:09:30.436 --> 00:09:31.504
a true test of where

00:09:31.504 --> 00:09:32.471
where all of this stands.

00:09:32.471 --> 00:09:33.739
Thank you both so very much.

